q-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">Yes, if you select a platform that enables WhatsApp coexistence, you can use the WhatsApp Business app or the WhatsApp Business API.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3"><span class="faq-title"><h3 id="what-is-the-cost-of-a-whatsapp-business-solution-provider">What is the cost of a WhatsApp business solution provider?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-3" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">The cost of WhatsApp features varies among different BSPs, depending on the offered services. A few of them charge a fixed monthly subscription, while others charge for message volume or active user counts. Always count extra charges, like WhatsApp’s message templates.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4"><span class="faq-title"><h3 id="is-it-safe-to-use-whatsapp-business-api">Is it safe to use WhatsApp Business API?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-4" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">Yes, if it is used properly. The official WhatsApp business API is safe to use. It consists of end-to-end encryption and follows WhatsApp’s security policies. Yet, users must be aware of using unofficial or third-party API that can cause security risks.</div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who are the Official WhatsApp API Providers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"WhatsApp Business API provider is an official partner authorized by Meta (like us at HelloBotz) that lets businesses do marketing, sales, and support using the popular messaging app, WhatsApp. We offer verified API access, automation tools, and seamless integration support that let companies send bulk messages, use an AI-powered chatbot, and connect with CRMs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does WhatsApp Business API allow bulk marketing messages to be sent?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, WhatsApp Business API helps to send thousands of messages at scale. Yet, the messages need to be pre-defined and pre-approved by Meta. Ensure you follow WhatsApp’s policies to avoid spamming users."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it possible to use the WhatsApp Business app or the WhatsApp API at the same time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, if you select a platform that enables WhatsApp coexistence, you can use the WhatsApp Business app or the WhatsApp Business API."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the cost of a WhatsApp business solution provider?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The cost of WhatsApp features varies among different BSPs, depending on the offered services. A few of them charge a fixed monthly subscription, while others charge for message volume or active user counts. Always count extra charges, like WhatsApp’s message templates."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it safe to use WhatsApp Business API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, if it is used properly. The official WhatsApp business API is safe to use. It consists of end-to-end encryption and follows WhatsApp’s security policies. Yet, users must be aware of using unofficial or third-party API that can cause security risks."}}]}</script>
